        "original_id": "33bffd70-6ac4-5170-991b-6afb96d97154",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tahmoh Penikett, Joss Whedon\n- Companies: Mutant Enemy Productions, Bellwether Pictures\n- TV series: Supernatural, Dollhouse, Continuum, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Angel, Firefly, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.\n\nFacts:\n- Joss Whedon is best known as the creator of the television series Buffy the Vampire Slayer (1997–2003).\n- Joss Whedon is best known as the creator of the television series Angel (1999–2004).\n- Joss Whedon is best known as the creator of the television series Firefly (2002).\n- Joss Whedon founded Mutant Enemy Productions.\n- Joss Whedon co-founded Bellwether Pictures.\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the TV series Supernatural.\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in Joss Whedon's TV series Dollhouse.\n- Joss Whedon is best known as the creator of the television series Dollhouse (2009–10).\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the Showtime time travel show Continuum.\n- Joss Whedon is best known as the creator of the television series Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. (from 2013).",
